  "openQuestions": [
    "The client never blocks an over-capacity booking: the planner only paints the cell (예약초과, count > capacity) and the booking side panel only shows a danger tone (count >= capacity). Whether the server rejects over-capacity bookings (other than the 409 duplicate) is unknown.",
    "Capacity reduction to 1 uses a different filter than the booking count: a rejected/pending external request (naver/kakao) with 추가예약제한 still reduces capacity to 1 but is itself not counted (see case 'rejected external request ... filter mismatch'). Probably unintended.",
    "The booking side panel counts bookings with only !취소여부 && !부도여부 (it does not drop pending/rejected external requests like the planner's mrn filter does) and treats count >= capacity as full, while the planner treats count > capacity as over. Which boundary should the server enforce?",
    "isPastDateTime treats the current minute as past (time <= now HH:mm), but the side panel's today cut-off keeps slots >= now (the current-minute slot is still offered). Pick one boundary on the server.",
    "Doctor half-day off ('오전 휴진'/'오후 휴진') is split by the lunch break of that day; with no lunch configured every slot counts as morning (오전 휴진 blocks the whole day, 오후 휴진 never blocks).",
    "In the booking side panel a doctor off-day (휴진일태그) only shows a warning; in the planner drag-move it blocks. The server needs one rule.",
    "In the booking side panel 차단(blocked) slots are not selectable at all, while planner drag-move asks for confirmation ('선택한 시간은 예약 차단된 시간입니다.') and allows it.",
    "점유건수 weighting: the server schema comment says '추가예약제한 OFF=1, ON=예약가능건수 만큼 가중' for the per-slot 점유건수 in /settings/doctors/appointments, but the planner cell counts 점유내역 by length. The server-side weighting rule is not visible in client code.",
    "Maximum booking length in the side panel is 120 minutes (floor(120 / 예약시간단위) slots); whether the server enforces this is unknown."
  ]
}
